{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-025",
    "title": "金丹劫前"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_136",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“他尚未完成选择。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "顾氏旧库燃烧的同一夜，玄霄宗收到了一封没有署名的信。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4225,
          "end": 4225
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "信从北境雪原方向送来，封口处没有蜡印，只有一圈被烧黑的铜丝。掌门没有打开，先将信交给了沈砚秋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4227,
          "end": 4227
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她在戒律堂偏厅拆开信封，里面是一张薄薄的证词纸。纸上只有三行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4229,
          "end": 4229
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前，太虚秩序启动。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4231,
          "end": 4231
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，第二盏灯归还人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4233,
          "end": 4233
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“今日，第三盏灯开始寻找欠债者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4235,
          "end": 4235
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "落款处写着一个她很久没有见过的名字：沈砚秋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4237,
          "end": 4237
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋坐在灯下，手指停在纸面。她知道这不是有人伪造，因为落款最后一笔会向内收，只有她自己写字时才有这个习惯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4239,
          "end": 4239
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来脚步声。玄霄宗掌门的亲传弟子推门而入：“掌门要你解释旧档。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4241,
          "end": 4241
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“解释哪一页？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4243,
          "end": 4243
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“西坡旧阵、归墟灵城、顾氏封存工程。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4245,
          "end": 4245
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这些都已经封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4247,
          "end": 4247
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临带走了两枚残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4249,
          "end": 4249
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋将证词纸折好：“所以你们终于想起要问。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4251,
          "end": 4251
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子皱眉：“你参与过三年前的删史。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4253,
          "end": 4253
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我参与过记录整理。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4255,
          "end": 4255
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把三个人的名字从名册上裁掉，也叫整理？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4257,
          "end": 4257
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们的名字已经被太虚秩序取走。留在纸上，只会让更多人被牵连。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4259,
          "end": 4259
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定取走？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4261,
          "end": 4261
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬眼：“当时所有人都同意。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4263,
          "end": 4263
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏同意了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4265,
          "end": 4265
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏有人同意，有人拒绝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4267,
          "end": 4267
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4269,
          "end": 4269
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "偏厅里最左边的长明灯忽然矮了一寸。沈砚秋看着火焰，没有立即回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4271,
          "end": 4271
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他选择留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4273,
          "end": 4273
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留下做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4275,
          "end": 4275
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“替我们守住一条不会被记住的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4277,
          "end": 4277
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子把一卷新抄的追捕令放到桌上。追捕令上不再写陆照临的名字，只写着“持印者”。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4279,
          "end": 4279
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“掌门要他活着回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4281,
          "end": 4281
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4283,
          "end": 4283
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为两枚残印已经拼合过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4285,
          "end": 4285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的目光落在追捕令上：“拼合到什么程度？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4287,
          "end": 4287
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只差第三枚，或一个真名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4289,
          "end": 4289
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她低声道：“不是第三枚，是第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4291,
          "end": 4291
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子盯着她：“你知道它在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4293,
          "end": 4293
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道它曾经在哪里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4295,
          "end": 4295
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“雪原？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4297,
          "end": 4297
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有否认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4299,
          "end": 4299
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她从案底取出一只旧木盒。木盒里没有法器，只有一枚褪色的铜钥匙和一张三年前的值夜记录。记录上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4301,
          "end": 4301
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“冬至前七日，沈砚秋于雪原点灯一次。灯火未归，同行三人失踪。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4303,
          "end": 4303
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把记录推给亲传弟子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4305,
          "end": 4305
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你的证词？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4307,
          "end": 4307
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4309,
          "end": 4309
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么现在才交？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4311,
          "end": 4311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为当时我也忘了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4313,
          "end": 4313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怎么想起来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4315,
          "end": 4315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋按住他的手：“不能截。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4341,
          "end": 4341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“掌门的命令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4343,
          "end": 4343
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他若真的拿到第三盏灯，玄霄宗必须先知道他看见了什么。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4345,
          "end": 4345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以要活捉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4347,
          "end": 4347
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“活捉之后呢？把他的记忆也删掉？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4349,
          "end": 4349
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4351,
          "end": 4351
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋将那张证词纸撕成两半，一半留在桌上，一半塞进袖中。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4353,
          "end": 4353
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我要去雪原。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4355,
          "end": 4355
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经不是引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4357,
          "end": 4357
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我从来没有成为过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4359,
          "end": 4359
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那三年前是谁点的灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4361,
          "end": 4361
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋看向长明灯：“一个相信自己能替所有人承担的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4363,
          "end": 4363
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她走出戒律堂，沿山道向西坡而去。经过第三盏灯时，她停下脚步。灯罩内壁浮出一行雾字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4365,
          "end": 4365
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋，第二次点灯候选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4367,
          "end": 4367
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有伸手触碰，只把铜钥匙插进灯座下的暗槽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4369,
          "end": 4369
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯火立刻熄灭。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4371,
          "end": 4371
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "可她没有做到。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4379,
          "end": 4379
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜以刀背挡开，剑尖擦过肩膀。鲜血落在雪地上，立刻被青光吸走。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4523,
          "end": 4523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别再用残印！”顾长离喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4525,
          "end": 4525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临咬紧牙，强行将青光压回掌心。气海深处却传来一声闷响，像有什么东西正在破壳。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4527,
          "end": 4527
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处第三盏灯忽然亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4529,
          "end": 4529
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯光照来，玄霄宗弟子同时停手。每个人的影子都被拉向灯光，影子里浮出不同的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4531,
          "end": 4531
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士看见自己的影子，失声道：“不可能。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4533,
          "end": 4533
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影子里的名字只有两个字：沈砚秋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4535,
          "end": 4535
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她曾经把自己的名字交给第三盏灯。”慧闻的声音从雪坡上方传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4537,
          "end": 4537
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰衣僧人独自走下雪坡，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面照过所有人，唯独陆照临的影子没有名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4539,
          "end": 4539
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他的名字还在门里。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4541,
          "end": 4541
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么意思？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4543,
          "end": 4543
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他尚未完成选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4545,
          "end": 4545
        }
      }
    ],
